  "improvements": [
    "Seven source parts previously removed by a generic scenery mask are preserved; source geometry now has explicit membership and cache validation.",
    "The monorail, sculpted shell and valid viewpoints remain in the scene.",
    "All seven exact native museum parts now retain their OSM metal colours and use scene-specific metal cladding without fabricated apartment windows; no source volume or collider is removed.",
    "Independent native pedestrian-aware travel reaches the exact public reading goal while preserving every source record, collider and visitor; the original failed static-planner attempt is retained as a separate diagnostic."
  ],
  "remainingGaps": [
    "The exact source parts remain visible around the older approximate sculpted shell. Their metal skin is corrected, but their straight mapped walls and unsupported sawtooth/butterfly roof families still need a unified source-faithful folded model; full silhouette agreement is not established.",
    "The shared static route can stop against a visitor. A separate pedestrian-aware native walk traverses 145.4 m to the exact Paul Allen reading point with all source buildings, colliders and visitors retained.",
    "The shared scene's first activity approach is the Space Needle entrance, not the MoPOP monorail viewpoint.",
    "The existing monorail handler can award on a single click while the train happens to pass; it needs real participation and cancellation coverage.",
    "Raw audit findings remain for physical review: zfight 53, phantom 1, pedBelow 3."
  ],
